  <item>
    <title>Ep18如何一步一步爱上跑步</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6697bccd37236c546ed5025c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6697bccd37236c546ed5025c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Jul 2024 12:45:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在本期节目里，我们一起回顾Coyee一步一步爱上跑步的过程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从跑步的契机，到跑步时遇到的各种困难和挑战，如何一步一步克服。以及跑步带给我们身体和心理上的变化、环境、文体消费品带给我我们的快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我相信很多人都有想跑步但却没有坚持下来的经历，本期节目我们也会和大家聊聊如何找到自己跑步的乐趣和动力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论你是从未跑过步的新手，还是曾经跑步但中途放弃的朋友。希望本期节目都能给你一些启发和鼓励。</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我们一起踏上跑步的旅程，一步一步爱上跑步吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a> 开始跑步和要追求速度嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="304">05:04</a> 现在的运动节奏、体重、无聊、环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="849">14:09</a> 跑步呼吸节奏的神奇时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1272">21:12</a> 正面应对不想跑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1383">23:03</a> 身边人对自己跑步的支持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2011">33:31</a> 跑步听的音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2478">41:18</a> 关于林肯公园的专辑《Hybrid Theory》和感情结束</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2792">46:32</a> 东亚人要发疯才能有精神出口嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2903">48:23</a> 太行山、五台山、这么近那么美 周末到河北 （北京也都是河北人。。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3237">53:57</a> 跑步时在听的播客和女性化内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3770">1:02:50</a> 不卷跑步装备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4268">1:11:08</a> 跑步的益处和吐槽，为什么10公里治矫情？重点是吐槽女士运动的不便和成本高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4617">1:16:57</a> 对距离认知的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4692">1:18:12</a> 那怕没有参加跑步社群，也要跑好自己一个人的广场舞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4979">1:22:59</a> 不要在一开始的时候找同路人，而是要在路上找同路人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5020">1:23:40</a> 下阶段准备体验半马</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5239">1:27:19</a> 如何一步一步爱上跑步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5504">1:31:44</a> Coyee在做的播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66836fc6ae11d6be9bc3f41b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66836fc6ae11d6be9bc3f41b"><span>Sunday Live</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Coyee运动记录图📷</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrjwtaiwBk-dke6FsJxHkXvrBxoh.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsOtnj_sSj3yJez8xtkhMk4VMos8.m4a" length="92323060" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:33:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fns3XPFsmQ0a9AxgT7YXpXL3UxtJ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
